An agnostic is a person who believes that the existence of god cannot be 
proved or disproved. They are abstaining from an opinion. Think of it 
like a vote - you have one vote, the poll is "God exists". You can 
either vote for it (theist), against it (atheist) or you can not vote 
(agnostic). There is no alternative because it is a statement - it is 
true or false.

